A. Enumerate n=5/n=6 partial assignments and search for minimal class-bases whose fibers separate A000568 classes with lower-order exclusion.
B. Add a packet-order column to HYP-3141 edge witnesses: which class can first be represented at order 0,1,2,... after fixed filler?
C. Run the same exact-order audit on HYP-3142 bounded-core U4 sidecars: the terminal k=8 obstruction should not be reachable by a lower-order quotient word.
